{#-
  check_report.txt.j2

  Generic report over host_rows_list, shared by the playbooks in this
  directory that produce check results rather than device inventory.

  Rendered ONCE, at 0600, with no masked counterpart. Both consumers pair
  hostnames with facts about what a device does or does not implement, and
  with host key material -- neither has an audience that wants a redacted
  version, and offering one invites forwarding. Compare
  playbooks/linux/templates/listener_report.txt.j2, which dual-renders
  because a masked socket sweep is genuinely useful to circulate.

  INPUT: host_rows_list, host_rows_counts -- see roles/host_rows.
-#}
================================================================================
{{ report_title }}
Generated {{ report_generated }} UTC

UNMASKED. Contains device names and collected values. Do not forward.
================================================================================

SUMMARY
  Hosts in scope    {{ host_rows_list | length }}
  Collected         {{ host_rows_list | selectattr('reachable') | list | length }}
  Not collected     {{ host_rows_list | rejectattr('reachable') | list | length }}

  Checks PASS       {{ host_rows_counts.PASS }}
  Checks FAIL       {{ host_rows_counts.FAIL }}
  Checks SKIP       {{ host_rows_counts.SKIP }}

  A SKIP is NOT a pass. Nothing was learned about that check, which is not
  the same as learning that it is fine.

{% for row in host_rows_list | sort(attribute='name') %}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{{ row.name }}  [{{ row.verdict }}]
{% if not row.reachable %}
  NOT COLLECTED -- {{ row.reason | default('no session established') }}
{#- No counts here. A zero for a device nobody reached renders as a
    measurement. See docs/gotchas.md entry 3. -#}
  Nothing was recorded for this device. Its state is unknown, not verified.
{% else %}
{% for check in row.checks %}
  {{ '%-6s' | format(check.status) }} {{ check.check }}
{%- if check.status != 'PASS' %}
           expected: {{ check.expected | default('') }}
           actual:   {{ check.actual | default('') }}
{% if check.reason | default('') %}           reason:   {{ check.reason | trim }}
{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{% else %}
  No checks were produced for this device.
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
